      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{602eb249dae5581a16eca7ec|full_name} - you can get a user's name from VRCPlayer Api > get displayName (https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/players#get-displayname). If you make avatar pedestals, you can have them automatically assign players to teams when they activate the pedestal to change into the avatar.",
